   "like_count": 15,
   "cooked": "<h1>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#how-to-join-the-token-engineering-commons-1\" name=\"how-to-join-the-token-engineering-commons-1\"></a><strong>How to Join the Token Engineering Commons</strong>\n</h1>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><img alt=\":wave:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/wave.png?v=10\" title=\":wave:\"/> Come say hello on our <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mUQvCm5Atm\">Discord</a> or <a href=\"https://t.me/tecommons\">Telegram</a> channels.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Drop in to the new joiners <strong>orientation</strong> on <strong>Wednesday, 7am PST / 18h CET</strong> on our <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/810180621930070088/810180622818869328\">community hall channel on Discord</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><img alt=\":phone:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/phone.png?v=10\" title=\":phone:\"/> Join our next <strong>Community Call</strong> on <strong>Thursday, 9am PST / 20h CET</strong> on our <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/810180621930070088/810180622818869328\">community hall channel on Discord</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><img alt=\":globe_with_meridians:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/globe_with_meridians.png?v=10\" title=\":globe_with_meridians:\"/> Feel free to <strong>join any of our calls</strong>! Add one or more to your <a href=\"https://calendar.google.com/calendar/u/0/embed?src=5mkep1ad1j860k6g7i7fr8plq0@group.calendar.google.com&amp;ctz=Europe/Berlin\">calendar</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><img alt=\":newspaper:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/newspaper.png?v=10\" title=\":newspaper:\"/> Connect with us and stay up to date by following the TEC on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/tecmns\">Twitter</a> and <a href=\"https://medium.com/token-engineering-commons\">Medium</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/818abcf1391712a13da1304b0391e3f93d16cb9d\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/818abcf1391712a13da1304b0391e3f93d16cb9d.png\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"itYPZAe6fSsx1O2NFZAKP4inkYt\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/818abcf1391712a13da1304b0391e3f93d16cb9d_2_10x10.png\" height=\"313\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/818abcf1391712a13da1304b0391e3f93d16cb9d_2_690x313.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/818abcf1391712a13da1304b0391e3f93d16cb9d_2_690x313.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/818abcf1391712a13da1304b0391e3f93d16cb9d.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/818abcf1391712a13da1304b0391e3f93d16cb9d.png 2x\" width=\"690\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">871×396 370 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><p></p>\n<p><img alt=\":seedling:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/seedling.png?v=10\" title=\":seedling:\"/> We are a blossoming and inclusive community with <strong>over 400 contributors from around the world</strong> and growing! <img alt=\":point_up:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/point_up.png?v=10\" title=\":point_up:\"/> Here’s a shot from one of our community calls on Thursdays – we <a href=\"https://www.notion.so/Calendar-be8a6868a6ef4305b7521fa35a2eb9ba\">warmly welcome you to join</a>!</p>\n<h1>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#how-to-contribute-2\" name=\"how-to-contribute-2\"></a><strong>How to Contribute</strong>\n</h1>\n<p>We welcome and appreciate participation and contributions and invite you to share your experience with us. All contributions are rewarded in <a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/how-to-earn-cstk-tec-tokens/113/2\">Impact Hours that turn into TEC &amp; CSTK tokens</a>.</p>\n<p>We have <strong>10 working groups</strong> building the commons. Below is a description of each working group with the forum handles for the 11 guiding stewards if you have any questions, or contact <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/vegayp\">@Vegayp</a>, our orientation coordinator.</p>\n<p><img alt=\":seedling:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/seedling.png?v=10\" title=\":seedling:\"/> <strong><a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/communitas-working-group/649\">Communitas</a></strong>  mission is to nurture, grow and guide the TEC community. The points of focus are new member orientation, current member community building, and organisational design: namely, guiding folks into the TEC and helping folks navigate the TEC from the inside.</p>\n<p><img alt=\":loud_sound:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/loud_sound.png?v=10\" title=\":loud_sound:\"/> <strong><a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/comms-working-group/162\">Comms</a></strong> is taking care of the narrative we present to the world, setting up our communication platforms and promoting TE projects. <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/chuygarcia92\">@chuygarcia92</a></p>\n<p><img alt=\":dove:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/dove.png?v=10\" title=\":dove:\"/> <strong><a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/gravity-working-group/177\">Gravity (conflict management)</a></strong> maintains community equilibrium and well-being through regular, open communication and, as needed, a system of graduated sanctions for conflict resolution; manages dispute escalation through the Celeste platform. <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/juankbell\">@Juankbell</a></p>\n<p><img alt=\":microscope:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/microscope.png?v=10\" title=\":microscope:\"/> <strong><a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/labs-working-group/410\">Labs</a></strong> is the central coordination sync point for the many TEC Labs events happening. <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ygg_anderson\">@ygg_anderson</a></p>\n<p><img alt=\":classical_building:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/classical_building.png?v=10\" title=\":classical_building:\"/> <strong><a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/legal-working-group/178\">Legal</a></strong> is researching relevant legal structures, looking into best and worst case scenarios and making sure we are prepared and able to avoid and manage pitfalls. <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/santigs\">@santigs</a></p>\n<p><img alt=\":dizzy:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/dizzy.png?v=10\" title=\":dizzy:\"/> <strong><a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/mega-working-group/334\">0mega</a></strong> examines the ethos of and ethics in token engineering as well as the shared vision and diversity of its communities. <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/solsista\">@Solsista</a></p>\n<p><img alt=\":raised_hands:t4:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/raised_hands/4.png?v=10\" title=\":raised_hands:t4:\"/> <strong><a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/soft-gov-working-group/163\">Soft Gov</a></strong> is researching best practices for governance and social collaboration. Organizing ourselves is one of the great challenges for humanity, also deeply affecting our economic perspectives. We orient ourselves through Elinor Ostrom’s 8 principles for governing a commons, for which she won the Noble Prize. <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/liviade\">@liviade</a></p>\n<p><img alt=\":ear_of_rice:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/ear_of_rice.png?v=10\" title=\":ear_of_rice:\"/> <strong><a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/community-stewards-wg/260\">Stewards</a></strong> collectively guides the various working groups (including the Stewards WG), coordinating work and communication efforts across the TEC community. <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/Tamara\">@Tamara</a></p>\n<p><img alt=\":female_detective:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/female_detective.png?v=10\" title=\":female_detective:\"/> <strong><a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/transparency-working-group/197\">Transparency</a></strong> proactively reinforces transparency and mutual monitoring across the TEC through different projects including the recording of all meetings. <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/iviangita\">@iviangita</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ZeptimusQ\">@ZeptimusQ</a></p>\n<p><em>More information coming soon about the newly born Sampo WG and Writer’s guild.</em><br/>\n<img alt=\":lollipop:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/lollipop.png?v=10\" title=\":lollipop:\"/> Looking forward to having you join the community! <img alt=\":wave:t5:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/wave/5.png?v=10\" title=\":wave:t5:\"/></p>",
